12. Accordingly, the Appeal merits consideration, in the result, the following:
ORDER (i) Appeal is partly allowed;
(ii) The impugned judgment and award passed by the Tribunal is modified;
(iii) The petitioners are entitled to total compensation of Rs.16,49,000/- with interest @ 6% per annum from the date of petition till its realization from the owner of the motor cycle;

